WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.900
Whirl a ball on a string, around
and around in a horizontal circle.

2
00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:07.730
Now sit in a car taking a sharp bend.

3
00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:10.510
You feel flung outwards, towards the door.

4
00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:14.010
People even give it a
name: centrifugal force.

5
00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:15.720
So back to the ball.

6
00:00:15.770 --> 00:00:18.630
Is anything actually pulling it outwards?

7
00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:21.470
In this mission, you'll
cut the string mid-swing,

8
00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:23.970
and find out which way the ball goes.

9
00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:28.760
Then you'll find out how fast a car
can take a flat bend before it skids.

10
00:00:28.810 --> 00:00:32.940
Your mission: find out whether
any force drags the ball outwards,

11
00:00:32.990 --> 00:00:34.190
and explain why.
